TITLE

PACE must learn from corrections once and stop re-asking; management
patterns must be permanently authorizable and self-classified by scope.

RAW_TEXT

PACE has to have a place to learn from its errors and not repeat them. I
do not want the AI asking me over and over to correct things it already
asked before. Management patterns must be establishable so I can authorize
them permanently, and PACE itself should learn whether a lesson is general
to the project or general to PACE.

